Statistics
Data was evaluated for statistical significance using parametric analysis in GraphPad Prism or SigmaPlot software (ANOVA in the case of three groups or paired T-tests in the case of two groups) and expressed as mean ± SEM. P < 0.05 was considered statistically significant.
